ode class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">658b0b6e-f60d-434c-8690-c2ea2b313f45</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:658b0b6e-f60d-434c-8690-c2ea2b313f45\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:658b0b6e-f60d-434c-8690-c2ea2b313f45\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Carried by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Jatlo\" title=\"Jatlo\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/55/Portrait_Jatlo.png/25px-Portrait_Jatlo.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/55/Portrait_Jatlo.png/38px-Portrait_Jatlo.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/55/Portrait_Jatlo.png/50px-Portrait_Jatlo.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Jatlo\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/55/Portrait_Jatlo.png/25px-Portrait_Jatlo.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/55/Portrait_Jatlo.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Jatlo\" title=\"Jatlo\">Jatlo</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>My darling,\n</p><p>Auntie has sent you a little present - a hex doll, just for you. Use it to scare those idiots off. Or butcher them, I don't care - just <i>find that book</i>. Or I'll rip out your lungs and feed them to your brothers.\n</p><p><br>\nLots of love, Auntie\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Part of the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Help_the_Hag_Survivors\" title=\"Help the Hag Survivors\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Help the Hag Survivors\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Help_the_Hag_Survivors\" title=\"Help the Hag Survivors\">Help the Hag Survivors</a></li>\n<li>The book Auntie Ethel is looking for is the <a href=\"/wiki/The_Hag%27s_Bane\" title=\"The Hag's Bane\">The Hag's Bane</a>, which contains its <a href=\"/wiki/Hag%27s_Bane\" title=\"Hag's Bane\">recipe</a></li></ul>\n<p>See also: \n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hag_Spy%27s_Note\" title=\"Hag Spy's Note\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a3/Book_Note_M_Item_Icon.png/25px-Book_Note_M_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a3/Book_Note_M_Item_Icon.png/38px-Book_Note_M_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a3/Book_Note_M_Item_Icon.png/50px-Book_Note_M_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a3/Book_Note_M_Item_Icon.png/25px-Book_Note_M_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a3/Book_Note_M_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for C